        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blockhead</strong> is a 50 level 2D platform puzzle game.  You are Blockhead who is lost and needs to find his way home.  Over the 50 levels you will encounter various characters and three (3) bullies who will try to stop you getting home.  You will have to collect ten (10) tokens in each level to advance to the next level.  You will gain the ability to Wipe and Freeze the bullies as you progress.  This will assist you in moving through the levels, getting  your tokens and advancing to the next level.  You can also get a jigsaw puzzle piece in each level, which will reveal a jigsaw puzzle as you play through the game.  You must complete each level in one go or you will have to try again.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blockhead</strong> is a 50 level 2D platform puzzle game.  You are Blockhead who is lost and needs to find his way home.  Over the 50 levels you will encounter various characters and three (3) bullies who will try to stop you getting home.  You will have to collect ten (10) tokens in each level to advance to the next level.  You will gain the ability to Wipe and Freeze the bullies as you progress.  This will assist you in moving through the levels, getting  your tokens and advancing to the next level.  You can also get a jigsaw puzzle piece in each level, which will reveal a jigsaw puzzle as you play through the game.  You must complete each level in one go or you will have to try again.</p>",
        "short_description": "Blockhead is lost. Can you help Blockhead find his way home? Move through 50 challenging levels by getting tokens, avoiding the bullies and getting help from the characters around you. Use keyboard and X Box controller to move and jump through this 2D platform game.",
